        "PMC7513042::chunk::000::abstract::b55c769615"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The NiCr interlayer forms a graded interface between the Cu substrate and the HEA coating.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The NiCr interlayer chemically bonds the Cu substrate to the HEA coating.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The NiCr interlayer mechanically bonds the Cu substrate to the HEA coating.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The NiCr interlayer reduces the thermal-expansion mismatch between Cu and the HEA coating.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The NiCr interlayer reduces the mechanical-property mismatch between Cu and the HEA coating.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing thermal and mechanical mismatches minimizes local stress concentrations under wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing thermal and mechanical mismatches lowers the risk of coating delamination.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A NiCr interlayer improves adhesion relative to direct HEA deposition on Cu.",
